---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import AIRouter from '../components/AIRouter.jsx';
import FromReddit from '../components/FromReddit.astro';
---
<Base title="ADHD Reflect" description="For ADHD parents raising ADHD kids. Work out what's happening before everyone escalates.">

  <!-- ─── Hero: AI Router ─── -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-inner">
      <p class="hero-label">For ADHD parents raising ADHD kids</p>
      <h1 class="hero-title">What just <em>happened?</em></h1>
      <p class="hero-body">
        Describe a hard moment. The tool names the specific ADHD dynamic underneath it, the part generic parenting advice usually walks straight past.
      </p>
      <AIRouter client:load />
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ─── Browse strip ─── -->
  <section class="browse">
    <div class="browse-inner">
      <p class="browse-label">Or start with one that sounds like your house</p>
      <div class="browse-chips">
        <a href="/cards/p01" class="browse-chip">The shame spiral after losing it</a>
        <a href="/cards/m01" class="browse-chip">The morning getting ready battle</a>
        <a href="/cards/m07" class="browse-chip">When their meltdown triggers yours</a>
        <a href="/cards/m04" class="browse-chip">The bedtime battle</a>
        <a href="/cards/p43" class="browse-chip">I lost it over something tiny</a>
        <a href="/cards/m12" class="browse-chip">When sibling conflict explodes</a>
        <a href="/cards/m53" class="browse-chip">The school called again</a>
        <a href="/cards/m02" class="browse-chip">The homework explosion</a>
      </div>
      <a href="/cards" class="browse-all">Browse every card &rarr;</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ─── Quiz CTA ─── -->
  <section class="quiz-cta">
    <div class="quiz-cta-inner">
      <div class="quiz-cta-content">
        <h2>Keep seeing the same pattern?</h2>
        <p>Take a three-minute quiz to see how your ADHD tends to show up when parenting gets hard. It is a reflective tool that points to the pattern underneath, rather than a clinical result.</p>
        <a href="/quiz" class="btn btn-primary">Find my pattern</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- ─── Install Prompt ─── -->
  <section class="install-prompt" id="install-section" style="display:none">
    <div class="install-inner">
      <div class="install-content">
        <div class="install-icon">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none">
            <path d="M32 6 C32 6, 48 16, 48 29 C48 37.8 40.8 44 32 44 C23.2 44 16 37.8 16 29 C16 16 32 6 32 6Z" fill="#4A6FA5"/>
            <path d="M32 58 C32 58, 48 48, 48 35 C48 26.2 40.8 20 32 20 C23.2 20 16 26.2 16 35 C16 48 32 58 32 58Z" fill="#A8C3A0" opacity="0.75"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="install-title">Save to your home screen</p>
          <p class="install-desc">Add it to your home screen and it opens straight to the search in one tap, with no app store to visit.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <button class="install-btn" id="install-btn">Add</button>
      <button class="install-dismiss" id="install-dismiss" aria-label="Dismiss">&times;</button>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ─── What this is ─── -->
  <section class="what">
    <div class="what-inner">
      <div class="what-block">
        <span class="what-icon">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><circle cx="10" cy="10" r="8" stroke="var(--blue)" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none"/><path d="M10 6v4l2.5 2.5" stroke="var(--blue)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
        </span>
        <h3>For the moment you're in</h3>
        <p>Short, specific help for the hard bit. After you yell, when homework collapses, when bedtime turns feral, or when you check out and feel guilty.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="what-block">
        <span class="what-icon">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><path d="M10 2C5.6 2 2 5.6 2 10s3.6 8 8 8 8-3.6 8-8-3.6-8-8-8z" stroke="var(--sage-dark)" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none"/><path d="M7 10l2 2 4-4" stroke="var(--sage-dark)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </span>
        <h3>Your pattern</h3>
        <p>Identify which ADHD parenting loop keeps catching you: Reactor, Juggler, Looper, Spiraller, or Escaper. Each has its own module sequence.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="what-block">
        <span class="what-icon">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none"><path d="M4 15V5a2 2 0 012-2h8a2 2 0 012 2v10" stroke="var(--lavender)" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none"/><path d="M2 15h16" stroke="var(--lavender)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
        </span>
        <h3>Want to go deeper?</h3>
        <p><a href="/grow" style="color:var(--lavender);text-decoration:none;font-weight:500">Both of You</a> is a self-guided program for parents who want to understand the pattern behind the moments, and have a plan for the next time it happens.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ─── Who this is for ─── -->
  <section class="who">
    <div class="who-inner">
      <h2>Sound familiar?</h2>
      <div class="who-list">
        <p>You know exactly what you're supposed to do. You do the opposite anyway. Every time.</p>
        <p>The parenting books describe a calm, consistent adult who can pause and choose. Your brain works differently, especially at 5.47pm when the pause you'd need is the first thing to go.</p>
        <p>You've tried the strategies. What you want is something built for the household you're in.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <FromReddit />



  <script>
    let deferredPrompt = null;
    
    window.addEventListener('beforeinstallprompt', (e) => {
      e.preventDefault();
      deferredPrompt = e;
      
      // Don't show if already dismissed
      if (localStorage.getItem('adhd-reflect-install-dismissed')) return;
      
      const section = document.getElementById('install-section');
      if (section) section.style.display = 'block';
    });
    
    document.getElementById('install-btn')?.addEventListener('click', async () => {
      if (!deferredPrompt) return;
      deferredPrompt.prompt();
      const result = await deferredPrompt.userChoice;
      deferredPrompt = null;
      document.getElementById('install-section').style.display = 'none';
    });
    
    document.getElementById('install-dismiss')?.addEventListener('click', () => {
      document.getElementById('install-section').style.display = 'none';
      localStorage.setItem('adhd-reflect-install-dismissed', 'true');
    });
    
    // Also show iOS install hint
    if (navigator.standalone === false || (navigator.userAgent.match(/iPhone|iPad/) && !window.navigator.standalone)) {
      const section = document.getElementById('install-section');
      if (section && !localStorage.getItem('adhd-reflect-install-dismissed')) {
        section.style.display = 'block';
        const desc = section.querySelector('.install-desc');
        if (desc) desc.textContent = 'Tap the share button, then Add to Home Screen. Opens straight to the search.';
        const btn = document.getElementById('install-btn');
        if (btn) btn.style.display = 'none';
      }
    }
  </script>

</Base>

<style>
  .hero { padding: var(--space-3xl) 0 var(--space-2xl); }
  .hero-inner { max-width: 640px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 var(--page-pad); }
  .hero-label {
    font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.22em;
    text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--blue); margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }
  .hero-title {
    font-family: var(--serif); font-size: clamp(30px, 5vw, 44px); font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.15; color: var(--slate); margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
    font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 48;
  }
  .hero-title em { font-style: italic; color: var(--blue); }
  .hero-body {
    font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--pewter);
    max-width: 480px; margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);
  }
  @media (max-width: 480px) { .hero { padding: var(--space-2xl) 0 var(--space-xl); } }

  .browse { padding: 0 0 var(--space-xl); }
  .browse-inner { max-width: 640px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 var(--page-pad); }
  .browse-label {
    font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--pewter); opacity: 0.7;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
  }
  .browse-chips { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: var(--space-sm); }
  .browse-chip {
    display: inline-block; padding: 9px 16px;
    background: white; border: 1px solid var(--mist-border);
    border-radius: 100px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--slate);
    text-decoration: none; line-height: 1.3;
    transition: border-color 0.15s, box-shadow 0.15s;
  }
  .browse-chip:hover { border-color: var(--blue); box-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(74,111,165,0.1); }
  .browse-all {
    font-size: 14px; color: var(--blue); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500;
  }
  .browse-all:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

  .quiz-cta { padding: var(--space-2xl) 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--mist-border); }
  .quiz-cta-inner { max-width: 640px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 var(--page-pad); }
  .quiz-cta-content {
    background: white; border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    border: 1px solid var(--mist-border); padding: var(--space-lg);
  }
  .quiz-cta-content h2 { font-size: 22px; margin-bottom: var(--space-sm); }
  .quiz-cta-content p {
    font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--pewter);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md); max-width: 480px;
  }

  .what { padding: var(--space-3xl) 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--mist-border); }
  .what-inner {
    max-width: var(--container-wide); margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 var(--page-pad);
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: var(--space-xl);
  }
  .what-block h3 {
    font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 19px; font-weight: 400;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm); font-variation-settings: 'opsz' 24;
  }
  .what-block p { font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--pewter); }
  .what-icon {
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    background: var(--mist); margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }
  @media (max-width: 640px) { .what-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

  .who {
    padding: var(--space-3xl) 0; background: white;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--mist-border); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--mist-border);
  }
  .who-inner { max-width: var(--container-max); margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 var(--page-pad); }
  .who-inner h2 { margin-bottom: var(--space-lg); }
  .who-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-md); }
  .who-list p {
    font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--pewter);
    padding-left: var(--space-lg); border-left: 2px solid var(--sage);
  }

  .newsletter-input:focus { border-color: var(--blue); }
  .newsletter-btn { padding: 12px 24px; white-space: nowrap; }
  .newsletter-note { font-size: 13px; color: var(--pewter); opacity: 0.6; margin-top: var(--space-sm); }
  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .newsletter-mock { flex-direction: column; }
    .newsletter-btn { width: 100%; }
  }

  .install-prompt {
    padding: var(--space-md) 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--mist-border);
  }
  .install-inner {
    max-width: 640px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 var(--page-pad);
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px;
  }
  .install-content {
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; flex: 1;
  }
  .install-icon {
    width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 12px;
    background: var(--mist); display: flex; align-items: center;
    justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .install-title {
    font-family: var(--sans); font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--slate); margin-bottom: 2px;
  }
  .install-desc {
    font-family: var(--sans); font-size: 13px; color: var(--pewter);
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
  .install-btn {
    appearance: none; border: none; cursor: pointer;
    background: var(--blue); color: white;
    font-family: var(--sans); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600;
    padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 100; white-space: nowrap;
    min-height: 40px;
  }
  .install-dismiss {
    appearance: none; border: none; cursor: pointer;
    background: transparent; color: var(--pewter);
    font-size: 20px; padding: 8px; line-height: 1;
    opacity: 0.5;
  }
</style>

